      <li id="src-1">Sax, B. (2007). <em>Crow</em>. Reaktion Books. — historical investigation of the Tower of London raven tradition and the absence of pre-20th-century documentation (pp. 112–119).</li>
      <li id="src-2">Skaife, C. (2018). <em>The Ravenmaster: My Life with the Ravens at the Tower of London</em>. Fourth Estate. — Ravenmaster's first-person account of raven care, wing clipping, and individual birds. (Institutional records; not peer-reviewed.)</li>
      <li id="src-3">Heinrich, B. (2000). <em>Mind of the Raven</em>. HarperCollins. — baseline on raven cognition, longevity, and individual personality in wild and captive birds.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-lore">[lore]</strong> named cultural/historical source · <strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed/field-guide</p>
